                "text": "I had the opportunity to sit down with Host Heather Howard and Prof. Niraj Jha on the Princeton Pulse Podcast to discuss the ways in which AI integration into our health care system promotes morality.\n\u00a0\nYou can listen to the full conversation on any streaming platform. https://t.co/mS2ac1mR7z",
