                "text": "For Arizonans, the dollar doesn\u2019t go as far as it used to. \n\nIn fact, Personal Consumption Expenditures per capita increased 7.2% ($27.1 billion) in 2023, spending\n- 12.1% more on rent, &\n- 9.5% more for health care.\n\nAcross all states, Arizona had the FIFTH highest % increase. https://t.co/mvsJqZBioJ",
